node_modules/<package>/LICENSE after an install. Versions are the ones this repository
installs from package.json, checked against the installed packages.

perfect-freehand 1.2.3: the outline of every stroke, from its points and the pen pressure
MIT
https://github.com/steveruizok/perfect-freehand

@excalidraw/laser-pointer 1.3.2: the trail of the laser
MIT
https://github.com/excalidraw/laser-pointer

rbush 4.0.1: the spatial index behind drawing, erasing and the lasso
MIT
https://github.com/mourner/rbush
It brings in quickselect 3.0.0, ISC.

pdfjs-dist 6.4.299: reading pdfs and drawing their pages
Apache-2.0
https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js

@pdfme/pdf-lib 6.2.2: writing the pdf export
MIT
https://github.com/pdfme/pdfme
It brings in pako (MIT and Zlib), @pdf-lib/standard-fonts, @pdf-lib/upng, color,
color-convert, color-string, color-name, node-html-better-parser and html-entities, all MIT.

idb 8.0.3: the IndexedDB wrapper notebooks, pages and files are stored through
